02:49.399 --> 02:50.534 align:center line:81%
Yes.

02:50.534 --> 02:53.570 align:center line:79%
He's our Savior
because He saves us from sin.

02:54.004 --> 02:55.505 align:center line:81%
He redeems us from death.

02:56.073 --> 02:57.240 align:center line:81%
